# Runtime xAI key is configured ONLY in the Vercel production project.
# GitHub Actions authenticates to the private production publisher via its
# built-in GitHub OIDC identity token. Do NOT add the key as a GitHub secret.
XAI_API_KEY=
XAI_MODEL=grok-4.7

# Only scheduled GitHub Actions may call POST /api/internal/daily-edition.
# The public site reads committed daily snapshot JSON and makes no paid calls.
# My X, arbitrary X profile lookups and free-text search are disabled.
